  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- feat: support dotted schema namespaces (#198) 2026-03-28\n- feat: add TreatWarningsAsErrors to SDK project template 2026-03-27\n- feat: Inline array support and deepObject serialization for object query params 2026-03-22\n- feat: Extract inline object schemas from bindings and skip object-type query params 2026-03-21\n- feat: Extract inline enum schemas from bindings.ws.query to components 2026-03-21\n- feat: Support inline schemas in bindings.ws.query + snapshot test 2026-03-21\n- feat: Generate typed ConnectAsync with query params from AsyncAPI channel bindings 2026-03-21\n- feat: Native upstream AsyncAPI spec support — inline payloads, per-channel servers, operationTraits 2026-03-21\n- feat: Add const discriminator support for AsyncAPI specs 2026-03-21\n- feat: Add unit tests for DeriveNameFromMethodAndPath and strip more version prefixes 2026-03-21\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- fix: handle inherited allof property collisions 2026-03-29\n- fix: use readable names for symbolic enum values 2026-03-29\n- fix: support fern streaming response metadata 2026-03-29\n- fix: rename object member property collisions 2026-03-28\n- fix: respect excluded models behind references 2026-03-28\n- fix: use sdk namespace for json serializer context types 2026-03-28\n- fix: stop model emission from depending on schema context 2026-03-28\n- fix: clear remaining solution build warnings 2026-03-28\n- fix: reduce remaining workflow annotations 2026-03-28\n- fix: clean repeated analyzer warnings 2026-03-28",
